# Auto

Use the participation/router service for the current judgment request. The
host runtime invokes the compatibility dispatcher with the exact command name
`auto` and injected services; no transcript, ledger, or hidden reasoning is
read.

Fixed control boundary:

`${PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/launch.sh control codex`

The source seam is:

`opensocrates.application.compatibility.dispatch_compatibility("auto", services=...)`
